/// 发布版本的检索行（从快照派生，只追加；typo_keys / phrasing_tsv 是生成列，不在 Prisma 里）
model HelpdeskFaqReleaseNode {
  releaseVersion Int      @map("release_version")
  id             String   @db.Uuid
  key            String
  nodeType       String   @map("node_type")
  entry          Boolean
  category       String
  popular        Boolean
  popularRank    Int?     @map("popular_rank")
  questionEn     String   @map("question_en")
  answerEn       String   @map("answer_en")
  questionZh     String   @map("question_zh")
  answerZh       String   @map("answer_zh")
  keywords       String[]
  signals        String[]
  status         String   @default("published")
  version        Int
  createdBy      String?  @map("created_by") @db.Uuid
  updatedBy      String?  @map("updated_by") @db.Uuid
  createdAt      DateTime @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)
  updatedAt      DateTime @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)
  phrasingText   String   @default("") @map("phrasing_text")

  release HelpdeskFaqRelease         @relation(fields: [releaseVersion], references: [version], onDelete: Restrict, onUpdate: NoAction)
  vectors HelpdeskFaqReleaseVector[]

  @@id([releaseVersion, id])
  @@map("helpdesk_faq_release_nodes")
}

/// FAQ 文本的向量（迁移 20261031110000_helpdesk_faq_vectors，faqVectors.ts）：同一模型下同一段文本只存一个，
/// 按 sha256 寻址，只追加。向量存 REAL[]；CHECK 与只追加触发器只在迁移里。
model HelpdeskFaqEmbedding {
  model     String
  textHash  String   @map("text_hash")
  text      String
  dims      Int
  embedding Float[]  @db.Real
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)

  releases HelpdeskFaqReleaseVector[]

  @@id([model, textHash])
  @@map("helpdesk_faq_embeddings")
}

/// 某一版的节点用了哪几段文本（source：question_en | question_zh | phrasing），只追加。
model HelpdeskFaqReleaseVector {
  releaseVersion Int    @map("release_version")
  model          String
  nodeId         String @map("node_id") @db.Uuid
  textHash       String @map("text_hash")
  source         String

  node      HelpdeskFaqReleaseNode @relation(fields: [releaseVersion, nodeId], references: [releaseVersion, id], onDelete: Restrict, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "helpdesk_faq_release_vectors_node_fkey")
  embedding HelpdeskFaqEmbedding   @relation(fields: [model, textHash], references: [model, textHash], onDelete: Restrict, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "helpdesk_faq_release_vectors_embedding_fkey")

  @@id([releaseVersion, model, nodeId, textHash])
  @@map("helpdesk_faq_release_vectors")
}

/// 发布前检查的分层结果缓存（迁移 20261106000000_helpdesk_eval_stage_cache，contracts/helpdesk-eval-cache.ts）：
/// layer = embed | rerank | step，key = 输入的 SHA-256（不存原文）；14 天后不再用。CHECK 只在迁移里；原生 SQL 读写。
model HelpdeskEvalStageCache {
  layer     String
  key       String
  value     Json
  latencyMs Int      @map("latency_ms")
  costUsd   Float    @default(0) @map("cost_usd")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)

  @@id([layer, key])
  @@index([createdAt])
  @@map("helpdesk_eval_stage_cache")
}

/// FAQ 的流程树与对象表（迁移 20261031120000_helpdesk_faq_map，faqMap.ts / faqMapRepository.ts）：一张节点表，
/// kind 区分 stage / step / deviation / object / cell。层级（触发器）、CHECK 与「每个对象每个属性一个格子」的
/// 部分唯一索引只在迁移里；BackOffice 原生 SQL 读写，不经 Prisma。发布时随快照冻结。
model HelpdeskFaqMapNode {
  id        String   @id @db.Uuid
  key       String   @unique(map: "helpdesk_faq_map_nodes_key_key")
  kind      String
  parentId  String?  @map("parent_id") @db.Uuid
  /// 只有对象有：它属于哪个阶段
  stageId   String?  @map("stage_id") @db.Uuid
  /// 只有格子有：definition | price | timing | limit | eligibility | visibility | consequence
  attribute String?
  position  Int      @default(0) @db.SmallInt
  labelEn   String   @map("label_en")
  labelZh   String   @map("label_zh")
  version   Int      @default(1)
  createdBy String?  @map("created_by") @db.Uuid
  updatedBy String?  @map("updated_by") @db.Uuid
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)
  updatedAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz(6)

  parent     HelpdeskFaqMapNode?    @relation("HelpdeskFaqMapNodeParent", fields: [parentId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "helpdesk_faq_map_nodes_parent_fkey")
  children   HelpdeskFaqMapNode[]   @relation("HelpdeskFaqMapNodeParent")
  stage      HelpdeskFaqMapNode?    @relation("HelpdeskFaqMapNodeStage", fields: [stageId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict, onUpdate: NoAction, map: "helpdesk_faq_map_nodes_stage_fkey")
  objects    HelpdeskFaqMapNode[]   @relation("HelpdeskFaqMapNodeStage")
  placements HelpdeskFaqPlacement[]

  @@index([parentId, position], map: "helpdesk_faq_map_nodes_parent_idx")
  @@map("helpdesk_faq_map_nodes")
}

/// 卡挂在哪（只挂在步骤、岔子或格子上；每张卡至多一个主位置 = 部分唯一索引，只在迁移里）
